drop view if exists GN_DW.GOLD.FACT_AD_BROADCAST_CASE__dbt_tmp cascade
[0m19:32:04.748299 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: SQL status: SUCCESS 1 in 0.142 seconds
[0m19:32:04.751046 [info ] [Thread-2 (]: 56 of 98 OK created sql incremental model GOLD.FACT_BUDGET_YEARLY .............. [[32mSUCCESS 111[0m in 3.03s]
[0m19:32:04.751860 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: Finished running node model.gn_dw_silver.FACT_BUDGET_YEARLY
