[0m19:32:04.753850 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: Re-using an available connection from the pool (formerly model.gn_dw_silver.FACT_BUDGET_YEARLY, now model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_MARKETING_CAMPAIGN)
[0m19:32:04.754357 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: Began compiling node model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_MARKETING_CAMPAIGN
